{
  "name": "Occult Association: Rosicrucian (Tier 4)",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Tier 4 — Rosicrucian</strong></p><p><strong>“When the Spark arrives, my people already have a place to put it.”</strong></p><p>At Tier 4, your order stops feeling like a club and starts feeling like infrastructure. When your faction achieves a Spark recovery, your network amplifies the downstream benefit.</p><p><strong>Strategic (Faction Scale)</strong></p><ul><li>When your faction successfully gathers a Spark of Light for the Great Work, increase the resulting <strong>Faction Resource Injection</strong> by <strong>20%</strong></li></ul><p>The Great Work is not just discovery. It is what happens <em>after</em> discovery — and you are built for that.</p><p><strong>Cost:</strong> once your network becomes the obvious place recovered value flows through, rivals, allies, and dependents all begin measuring you by whether that flow ever stops.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
